WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.783
The two cards distinguish a named deputy from the acceptance still needed.

00:00:03.783 --> 00:00:07.567
Aisha’s name does not automatically confirm every assignment or an unlimited period

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:11.350
of availability.

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:15.458
Look for the agreed work, period, authority, access and explicit acceptance. Record

00:00:15.458 --> 00:00:19.383
limitations and open actions so the handover is usable rather than merely

00:00:19.383 --> 00:00:23.308
reassuring.

00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:28.433
The separate room lane remains under its own service mandate and duty

00:00:28.433 --> 00:00:33.333
owner. Administrative handover does not create a control-room service guarantee.
